5
00:59:34.018 --> 00:59:42.018
God has shown step by step, miracle by miracle, that this is my plan.

6
00:59:42.018 --> 00:59:46.018
The time has come. We are going to start the construction.

7
00:59:47.018 --> 00:59:50.018
