8
00:59:50.018 --> 00:59:57.018
And as I look in the Bible at how often there have been large collections,

9
00:59:57.018 --> 00:59:59.018
that is incredible.

10
00:59:59.018 --> 01:00:04.018
For example, there was a collection to build the tabernacle.

11
01:00:04.018 --> 01:00:09.018
The tabernacle is a mobile temple that can be taken along.

12
01:00:09.018 --> 01:00:11.018
