13
01:00:11.018 --> 01:00:15.018
How much was collected in gold and precious stones for that.

14
01:00:15.018 --> 01:00:19.018
And later for the construction of the temple, the stone temple.

15
01:00:19.018 --> 01:00:25.018
How much was raised for that is truly incredible.

16
01:00:25.018 --> 01:00:30.018
But also when the ark is brought back into Jerusalem.

17
01:00:30.018 --> 01:00:38.018
How much was collected for that, how many bulls and lambs were gathered to be offered.

18
01:00:38.018 --> 01:00:44.018
And later again the rebuilding of the temple after it was destroyed to rebuild it.

19
01:00:44.018 --> 01:00:48.018
