20
01:00:48.018 --> 01:00:54.018
Somewhere it even states that more than a billion euros was raised.

21
01:00:54.018 --> 01:00:57.018
If you were to convert it to now.

22
01:00:57.018 --> 01:00:59.018
That would be very intimidating.

23
01:00:59.018 --> 01:01:03.018
