340
01:17:39.018 --> 01:17:41.018
Can we say an amen to that.

341
01:17:42.018 --> 01:17:46.018
I pray that God will be good to you in more and more things.

342
01:17:46.018 --> 01:17:50.018
Also that you will have more and more of God's peace.

343
01:17:50.018 --> 01:17:53.018
Hallelujah. I bless you with peace in your heart.

344
01:17:53.018 --> 01:17:57.018
Hallelujah. I bless you in this time with peace.

345
01:17:57.018 --> 01:17:59.018
I don't know for whom this is.

346
01:17:59.018 --> 01:18:02.018
But if you need peace, you must go to God.

347
01:18:02.018 --> 01:18:05.018
If you need peace, and everyone needs it.

348
01:18:05.018 --> 01:18:08.018
People draw from all sorts of things.

349
01:18:08.018 --> 01:18:11.018
Ultimately for this end goal.

350
01:18:11.018 --> 01:18:12.018
Everyone wants to have peace.

351
01:18:12.018 --> 01:18:14.018
And we try to draw it from.

352
01:18:14.018 --> 01:18:17.018
We try to cause it by.

353
01:18:17.018 --> 01:18:19.018
And we try to draw it from.

354
01:18:19.018 --> 01:18:23.018
But ultimately, there is only one person through whom to get peace.

355
01:18:23.018 --> 01:18:25.018
And His name is Jesus.

356
01:18:25.018 --> 01:18:26.018
Verse 3.

357
01:18:36.018 --> 01:18:39.018
Has He made new people out of us?

358
01:18:39.018 --> 01:18:43.018
If you are taking notes in your Bible, you may underline.

359
01:18:43.018 --> 01:18:47.018
He has made new people out of us.

360
01:18:47.018 --> 01:18:50.018
I ask myself the question of what is written here.

361
01:18:50.018 --> 01:18:52.018
Who has made new people out of us?

362
01:18:52.018 --> 01:18:55.018
He has made new people out of us.

363
01:18:55.018 --> 01:18:58.018
So who has made new people?

364
01:18:58.018 --> 01:19:00.018
Definitely not.

365
01:19:01.018 --> 01:19:04.018
I don't want to laugh.

366
01:19:04.018 --> 01:19:09.018
