367
01:19:09.018 --> 01:19:14.018
Yes, I know. Absolutely good.

368
01:19:14.018 --> 01:19:17.018
And when you put on that t-shirt, super good.

369
01:19:17.018 --> 01:19:20.018
I have decided. That's right.

370
01:19:20.018 --> 01:19:22.018
But.

371
01:19:23.018 --> 01:19:26.018
I propose that there should be a t-shirt.

372
01:19:26.018 --> 01:19:28.018
He chose me.

373
01:19:28.018 --> 01:19:31.018
Because that's cool. Do you understand what I mean?

374
01:19:31.018 --> 01:19:33.018
Because I have decided.

375
01:19:33.018 --> 01:19:35.018
What I read here that Peter says.

376
01:19:35.018 --> 01:19:41.018
The emphasis, the focus is very little on ourselves.

377
01:19:41.018 --> 01:19:47.018
Very little is said about us that we have made new people out of ourselves.

378
01:19:47.018 --> 01:19:49.018
That is not what it says.

379
01:19:49.018 --> 01:19:53.018
It says He has made new people out of us. Hallelujah.

380
01:19:53.018 --> 01:19:56.018
We are born again.

381
01:19:56.018 --> 01:20:00.018
He did this by raising Tim from the dead.

382
01:20:00.018 --> 01:20:01.018
Oh, wait.

383
01:20:01.018 --> 01:20:04.018
He did this by raising Chris from the dead.

384
01:20:04.018 --> 01:20:05.018
Oh, no, wait.

385
01:20:05.018 --> 01:20:08.018
He did this by raising Els. No, wait.

386
01:20:08.018 --> 01:20:15.018
He did this by calling Jesus Christ back from the dead and giving life again.

387
01:20:15.018 --> 01:20:18.018
Because of this, we can be full of hope.

388
01:20:18.018 --> 01:20:23.018
For now we expect an inheritance that will never lose its value.

389
01:20:23.018 --> 01:20:26.018
That inheritance is ready for us in heaven, eternal life.

390
01:20:26.018 --> 01:20:33.018
I had underlined in this last Bible verse here that it simply cannot be more beautiful.

391
01:20:33.018 --> 01:20:34.018
Check this.

392
01:20:34.018 --> 01:20:36.018
His plan.

393
01:20:36.018 --> 01:20:37.018
He wants.

394
01:20:37.018 --> 01:20:39.018
He calls.

395
01:20:39.018 --> 01:20:42.018
He cleanses us through Jesus.

396
01:20:42.018 --> 01:20:44.018
And He gives us an inheritance.

397
01:20:44.018 --> 01:20:48.018
It cannot be easier.

398
01:20:48.018 --> 01:20:50.018
Suppose it were to be.

399
01:20:50.018 --> 01:20:51.018
You must.

400
01:20:51.018 --> 01:20:55.018
For this is how you may become a new person.

401
01:20:55.018 --> 01:21:03.018
And if you do that through that, by that and your blood and your dying and your difficult, difficult, difficult.

402
01:21:03.018 --> 01:21:05.018
Maybe there is a reward waiting for you someday.

403
01:21:05.018 --> 01:21:07.018
That is not what the Bible says.

404
01:21:07.018 --> 01:21:10.018
The Bible says it was His will.

405
01:21:10.018 --> 01:21:12.018
He had a plan.

406
01:21:12.018 --> 01:21:15.018
That plan was already written before the foundation of the world.

407
01:21:15.018 --> 01:21:19.018
Here we must learn this way of speaking.

408
01:21:19.018 --> 01:21:22.018
Even before the foundation of the world.

409
01:21:22.018 --> 01:21:24.018
Even before the world was made.

410
01:21:24.018 --> 01:21:27.018
Even before God made the blueprint.

411
01:21:27.018 --> 01:21:30.018
Even before He laid a foundation for the earth.

412
01:21:30.018 --> 01:21:33.018
Even before He said, let there be light.

413
01:21:33.018 --> 01:21:37.018
Even before He said, let there be trees, birds, fish, and people.

414
01:21:37.018 --> 01:21:43.018
Before everything happened, He was at His own drawing board and said, I have a plan.

415
01:21:43.018 --> 01:21:48.018
And that is to bring humanity to salvation through my own Son Jesus Christ.

416
01:21:48.018 --> 01:21:50.018
It has always been His plan.

417
01:21:50.018 --> 01:21:53.018
It is not our progressive insight.

418
01:21:53.018 --> 01:21:55.018
It is not our plans.

419
01:21:55.018 --> 01:21:56.018
It is not our work.

420
01:21:56.018 --> 01:21:58.018
We have not made new people from ourselves.

421
01:21:58.018 --> 01:22:00.018
But it is the wonderful work.

422
01:22:00.018 --> 01:22:04.018
And I would love it if we could give Him the glory and honor.

423
01:22:04.018 --> 01:22:07.018
It is the wonderful work of King Jesus.

424
01:22:07.018 --> 01:22:10.018
Through God's plan that we can be children of God.

425
01:22:10.018 --> 01:22:14.018
And that we will receive the inheritance of Jesus Himself in heaven.

426
01:22:14.018 --> 01:22:15.018
Amen.

427
01:22:17.018 --> 01:22:21.018
Here it also says praise God.

428
01:22:21.018 --> 01:22:23.018
I found this so beautiful.

429
01:22:23.018 --> 01:22:25.018
We will skip a few verses.

430
01:22:25.018 --> 01:22:28.018
