435
01:22:38.018 --> 01:22:46.018
He has redeemed you from the futile way of life inherited from your ancestors.

436
01:22:46.018 --> 01:22:47.018
But remember.

437
01:22:47.018 --> 01:22:49.018
And this is what Robert just said.

438
01:22:49.018 --> 01:22:51.018
