439
01:22:51.018 --> 01:22:53.018
Here it says exactly what it says.

440
01:22:53.018 --> 01:22:54.018
What he said.

441
01:22:54.018 --> 01:22:59.018
But remember that you were not redeemed with gold or silver.

442
01:23:00.018 --> 01:23:01.018
Glory hallelujah.

443
01:23:01.018 --> 01:23:06.018
You were redeemed with the precious blood of Christ.

444
01:23:06.018 --> 01:23:08.018
The perfect lamb of sacrifice.

445
01:23:08.018 --> 01:23:11.018
Glory to the name of Jesus.

446
01:23:11.018 --> 01:23:12.018
It is not gold.

447
01:23:12.018 --> 01:23:14.018
It is not gemstones.

448
01:23:14.018 --> 01:23:16.018
It is nothing you can adorn yourself with.

449
01:23:16.018 --> 01:23:19.018
It is nothing you would find valuable.

450
01:23:19.018 --> 01:23:23.018
We find a whole lot of things valuable in our human thinking.

451
01:23:23.018 --> 01:23:25.018
But God finds only one thing truly valuable.

452
01:23:25.018 --> 01:23:27.018
And that is obedience.

453
01:23:27.018 --> 01:23:30.018
And he could find obedience nowhere in this world.

454
01:23:30.018 --> 01:23:33.018
Except through his wonderful son Jesus Christ.

455
01:23:33.018 --> 01:23:36.018
Hallelujah. Glory to the name of Jesus.

456
01:23:38.018 --> 01:23:40.018
1 Peter chapter 2.

457
01:23:40.018 --> 01:23:42.018
Verse 1 says then.

458
01:23:42.018 --> 01:23:46.018
So put away all that is bad.

459
01:23:46.018 --> 01:23:49.018
So. The word 'so' can be replaced.

460
01:23:49.018 --> 01:23:51.018
For 'so.'

461
01:23:51.018 --> 01:23:52.018
Therefore.

462
01:23:52.018 --> 01:23:53.018
Therefore.

463
01:23:53.018 --> 01:23:54.018
Then.

464
01:23:54.018 --> 01:23:55.018
Then.

465
01:23:55.018 --> 01:23:59.018
It is a reaction word.

466
01:23:59.018 --> 01:24:01.018
Please take a look at these words.

467
01:24:01.018 --> 01:24:03.018
So put away everything that is bad.

468
01:24:03.018 --> 01:24:06.018
And then and so on and so on we will read like this.

469
01:24:06.018 --> 01:24:09.018
So put away everything that is bad.

470
01:24:09.018 --> 01:24:13.018
This is the reaction we give to God.

471
01:24:13.018 --> 01:24:16.018
God has set us free.

472
01:24:16.018 --> 01:24:21.018
He paid with the blood of His Son for our sins.

473
01:24:21.018 --> 01:24:24.018
We have been made new by Him.

474
01:24:24.018 --> 01:24:28.018
The only thing we need to do is to respond.

475
01:24:28.018 --> 01:24:33.018
What we do here on earth is nothing from ourselves.

476
01:24:33.018 --> 01:24:35.018
He is the Creator.

477
01:24:35.018 --> 01:24:37.018
And God says to Adam.

478
01:24:37.018 --> 01:24:40.018
Continue with my creation.

479
01:24:40.018 --> 01:24:44.018
So recreation is what God has made.

480
01:24:44.018 --> 01:24:46.018
With that, we will continue.

481
01:24:46.018 --> 01:24:50.018
And because man has broken things, we can also renovate in the name of Jesus.

482
01:24:50.018 --> 01:24:51.018
Just then another sermon.

483
01:24:51.018 --> 01:24:54.018
But everything we do, dear people, in the church.

484
01:24:54.018 --> 01:24:59.018
Everything we do is a response to the love of God.

485
01:24:59.018 --> 01:25:05.018
And that response is not that we have to take care of the salvation plan.

486
01:25:05.018 --> 01:25:08.018
That response is not what Vanessa said just last week.

487
01:25:08.018 --> 01:25:11.018
About collecting the money, which is so true.

488
01:25:11.018 --> 01:25:13.018
And you see it in the Bible time and again.

489
01:25:13.018 --> 01:25:17.018
That money is collected for building the tabernacles and the temple.

490
01:25:17.018 --> 01:25:18.018
And all those kinds of things.

491
01:25:18.018 --> 01:25:22.018
But ultimately it is still always God's provision.

492
01:25:22.018 --> 01:25:24.018
He is always the first.

493
01:25:24.018 --> 01:25:27.018
And whatever is always added, Debbie.

494
01:25:27.018 --> 01:25:28.018
What you just indeed read out loud.

495
01:25:28.018 --> 01:25:33.018
What is always added is that those people who came to give.

496
01:25:33.018 --> 01:25:37.018
They came to give as a joy offering.

497
01:25:37.018 --> 01:25:40.018
They always came with a wow to the Lord.

498
01:25:40.018 --> 01:25:45.018
So when you give for God, it is a response of the wow that you have yourself.

499
01:25:45.018 --> 01:25:48.018
Because as Paul also says.

500
01:25:48.018 --> 01:25:52.018
If you give from something that is bitter.

501
01:25:52.018 --> 01:25:53.018
I actually don't want to.

502
01:25:53.018 --> 01:25:54.018
Then you especially shouldn't do it.

503
01:25:54.018 --> 01:25:58.018
For God says you must always give from a joyful heart.

504
01:25:58.018 --> 01:26:00.018
But what is a joyful heart?

505
01:26:00.018 --> 01:26:03.018
What Peter said in 1 Peter chapter 1.

506
01:26:03.018 --> 01:26:06.018
We are very grateful to God.

507
01:26:06.018 --> 01:26:07.018
Grateful.

508
01:26:07.018 --> 01:26:12.018
Gratitude is always a reaction to the action.

509
01:26:12.018 --> 01:26:13.018
Amen.

510
01:26:13.018 --> 01:26:16.018
So put away everything that is bad.

511
01:26:16.018 --> 01:26:20.018
All deceit, jealousy, and slander.

512
01:26:20.018 --> 01:26:24.018
Long for the pure Word of God's truth.

513
01:26:24.018 --> 01:26:28.018
Just like newborn babies long for pure, undiluted milk.

514
01:26:28.018 --> 01:26:31.018
For by that you will grow up.

515
01:26:31.018 --> 01:26:35.018
Through God's Word you will taste how good and kind the Lord is.

516
01:26:35.018 --> 01:26:37.018
And come to Jesus.

517
01:26:37.018 --> 01:26:41.018
He is the living stone with which God wanted to build His house.

518
01:26:41.018 --> 01:26:46.018
People have rejected him, but God has chosen him.

519
01:26:46.018 --> 01:26:49.018
Underline the word chosen.

520
01:26:49.018 --> 01:26:52.018
God did not just choose you at random.

521
01:26:52.018 --> 01:26:54.018
