I want to remain under what John says, with Jesus.

1059
01:48:38.018 --> 01:48:40.018
Dear church, stay with Jesus.

1060
01:48:40.018 --> 01:48:42.018
Stay with his truth.

1061
01:48:42.018 --> 01:48:47.018
For the work that he has begun in you, he will surely finish.

1062
01:48:47.018 --> 01:48:54.018
My last lesson that I want to show is that God chose you for his glory.

1063
01:48:54.018 --> 01:48:55.018
That is very important.

1064
01:48:55.018 --> 01:48:58.018
Lesson 1, God took the first initiative.

1065
01:48:58.018 --> 01:49:01.018
Lesson 2, and what God begins, he also finishes.

1066
01:49:01.018 --> 01:49:04.018
My last lesson is that God,

1067
01:49:04.018 --> 01:49:07.018
it is important to know that we are chosen and called,

1068
01:49:07.018 --> 01:49:11.018
is because he chose us for his glory.

1069
01:49:11.018 --> 01:49:13.018
We are made for him.

1070
01:49:13.018 --> 01:49:15.018
We are not made for ourselves.

1071
01:49:15.018 --> 01:49:19.018
You are not just thrown on this earth to figure it out.

1072
01:49:19.018 --> 01:49:24.018
But you are placed on this earth carefully for his glory.

1073
01:49:24.018 --> 01:49:27.018
For he has a plan for your life.

1074
01:49:27.018 --> 01:49:34.018
You know, when he calls you, there is a calling attached to it.

1075
01:49:34.018 --> 01:49:37.018
Isaiah 43, verse 7, and BV says,

1076
01:49:37.018 --> 01:49:42.018
Everyone who is called by my name, I have created for my glory.

1077
01:49:42.018 --> 01:49:45.018
I have formed them, I have made them.

1078
01:49:45.018 --> 01:49:48.018
God loves you for himself.

1079
01:49:48.018 --> 01:49:52.018
God is very jealous and very selfish with you.

1080
01:49:52.018 --> 01:49:55.018
He wants you for himself.

1081
01:49:55.018 --> 01:49:58.018
He wants you to breathe for His glory.

1082
01:49:58.018 --> 01:50:02.018
When you couldn't even talk yet and were growing in your mother's womb,

1083
01:50:02.018 --> 01:50:04.018
you already gave Him honor.

1084
01:50:04.018 --> 01:50:07.018
Because He loves you just as you are.

1085
01:50:07.018 --> 01:50:08.018
Hallelujah.

1086
01:50:08.018 --> 01:50:10.018
Romans 11, verse 36.

1087
01:50:10.018 --> 01:50:15.018
For all things that come from God exist through God and are for God.

1088
01:50:15.018 --> 01:50:20.018
For Him is all honor forever and ever. Amen.

1089
01:50:20.018 --> 01:50:22.018
So it is. Hallelujah.

1090
01:50:22.018 --> 01:50:30.018
But if we know within ourselves that we are called and chosen,

1091
01:50:30.018 --> 01:50:33.018
then I hear the word called.

1092
01:50:33.018 --> 01:50:36.018
He calls you for His glory.

1093
01:50:36.018 --> 01:50:39.018
He chooses you for His glory, I can accept that, choice.

1094
01:50:39.018 --> 01:50:42.018
But He also calls you with a task.

1095
01:50:42.018 --> 01:50:46.018
That's why you often hear people say, it's a calling on my life.

1096
01:50:46.018 --> 01:50:50.018
But that calling is also the selection He has made for your life.

1097
01:50:50.018 --> 01:50:56.018
You are not selected to just come to repentance and that's it.

1098
01:50:56.018 --> 01:51:00.018
You are indeed selected for His purpose.

1099
01:51:00.018 --> 01:51:05.018
He chose Adam and Eve as His first people to cultivate the earth.

1100
01:51:05.018 --> 01:51:07.018
Be fruitful and multiply.

1101
01:51:07.018 --> 01:51:10.018
He called Abel as the first true worshiper and martyr.

1102
01:51:10.018 --> 01:51:14.018
And Abel's blood cried out to the Creator from the ground of the earth.

1103
01:51:14.018 --> 01:51:19.018
He chose Noah to build a boat, but did not ask Nimrod to build a tower.

1104
01:51:19.018 --> 01:51:25.018
He called Abraham to leave his land and decided to bless all nations through him.

1105
01:51:25.018 --> 01:51:33.018
He called Isaac to carry on the promises to Abraham and chose to name Jacob Israel.

1106
01:51:33.018 --> 01:51:37.018
He chose Israel among all nations to be the light in the world.

1107
01:51:37.018 --> 01:51:40.018
He chose Joseph to lead first and then to guide.

1108
01:51:40.018 --> 01:51:46.018
He called Moses to free Israel and chose Joshua to lead them into the promised land.

1109
01:51:46.018 --> 01:51:50.018
He chose the judges to deliver Israel with God's magnificent hand.

1110
01:51:50.018 --> 01:51:57.018
He reluctantly chose a king for the people but called David from the field as a king after God's own heart.

1111
01:51:58.018 --> 01:52:04.018
God visited Solomon in his dream and chose him to show the world His glory and wisdom.

1112
01:52:04.018 --> 01:52:12.018
God preferred the prophets to call the people back to the Father's heart rather than the kings who did not live according to God's calling.

1113
01:52:12.018 --> 01:52:18.018
After Malachi, God called very little for 400 years and there seemed to be a radio silence.

1114
01:52:18.018 --> 01:52:25.018
The Maccabees and the Zealots tried but had no results without the call and the victory in God's power.

1115
01:52:25.018 --> 01:52:29.018
Here I added, church, never do anything in your own strength.

1116
01:52:29.018 --> 01:52:33.018
Without the calling of God, it just doesn't work.

1117
01:52:33.018 --> 01:52:37.018
Without the calling of God, there are no results, hallelujah.

1118
01:52:37.018 --> 01:52:41.018
But after 400 years of silence, God called Creepy John from the wilderness.

1119
01:52:41.018 --> 01:52:46.018
He cried out, prepare yourselves for the coming of the Messiah.

1120
01:52:46.018 --> 01:52:50.018
God called all those people and then the King of kings appeared.

1121
01:52:50.018 --> 01:52:58.018
Fully God, fully man, God chose his son to lead on a cross for the forgiveness of all humanity.

1122
01:52:58.018 --> 01:53:01.018
To Jesus all glory and honor.

1123
01:53:01.018 --> 01:53:09.018
Jesus chose 12 disciples and then another 72 to cast out demons and spread the good news about Jesus all over the earth.

1124
01:53:09.018 --> 01:53:14.018
Jesus chose the apostles to establish and lead the churches for his name.

1125
01:53:15.018 --> 01:53:21.018
And he called his beloved apostle to look at the final plan of the new heaven and the new earth in heaven, John.

1126
01:53:21.018 --> 01:53:30.018
If God is the same yesterday, today, and forever and he called the men and women of God in the Bible for his name and glory, then he is also calling you.

1127
01:53:30.018 --> 01:53:33.018
Shall we stand, for I want to pray for you.

1128
01:53:41.018 --> 01:53:43.018
I will also close the service immediately.

1129
01:53:44.018 --> 01:53:46.018
Shall we please close our eyes?

1130
01:53:50.018 --> 01:53:52.018
Hallelujah, let us come to prayer.

1131
01:53:52.018 --> 01:53:57.018
Let us come to prayer please and let us focus ourselves on God.

1132
01:53:59.018 --> 01:54:08.018
King of Kings, Lord of Lords, I thank you, Lord, that you have chosen us as a people of priests and kings.

1133
01:54:09.018 --> 01:54:12.018
Lord, I thank you, Lord, that it does not depend on our work.

1134
01:54:12.018 --> 01:54:14.018
It is in any case what we have done.

1135
01:54:14.018 --> 01:54:22.018
It is not our work that justifies us, but it is the work of King Jesus that has set us free, that has liberated us.

1136
01:54:22.018 --> 01:54:29.018
It is the blood of Jesus that has set you free at the cross of Golgotha, 2000 years ago.

1137
01:54:29.018 --> 01:54:33.018
Jesus has personally chosen you.

1138
01:54:33.018 --> 01:54:36.018
And while all eyes are closed, I want to declare this over us.

1139
01:54:36.018 --> 01:54:39.018
He has chosen you for your family.

1140
01:54:39.018 --> 01:54:41.018
He has chosen you for your business.

1141
01:54:41.018 --> 01:54:44.018
He has chosen you for the village where you live.

1142
01:54:44.018 --> 01:54:49.018
He has chosen you to shine His glory in a dark world.

1143
01:54:49.018 --> 01:54:54.018
He has chosen you to convey the wisdom of God to other people.

1144
01:54:54.018 --> 01:54:58.018
He has chosen you to be joyful in the name of Jesus.

1145
01:54:58.018 --> 01:55:04.018
He has chosen you to worship Him with the angels and with all of creation.

1146
01:55:04.018 --> 01:55:08.018
He has chosen you because of Jesus Christ.

1147
01:55:08.018 --> 01:55:11.018
And I want to ask a question to everyone in this room.

1148
01:55:11.018 --> 01:55:15.018
Have you already responded to the action of God?

1149
01:55:18.018 --> 01:55:21.018
Have you already made a choice for King Jesus?

1150
01:55:22.018 --> 01:55:25.018
Have you already added Him to your life?

1151
01:55:25.018 --> 01:55:28.018
For He has added you to His life.

1152
01:55:28.018 --> 01:55:34.018
And there is nothing more beautiful than leading a life in Christ Jesus.

1153
01:55:34.018 --> 01:55:36.018
Hallelujah.

1154
01:55:38.018 --> 01:55:43.018
Michiel, perhaps it is good that we read this prayer together at the end of this service.

1155
01:55:43.018 --> 01:55:46.018
We often have a prayer on the screen.

1156
01:55:46.018 --> 01:55:48.018
And this is a prayer in which we can show.

1157
01:55:48.018 --> 01:55:50.018
Michiel, you can show it.

1158
01:55:50.018 --> 01:55:53.018
There is a prayer that I have written out.

1159
01:55:53.018 --> 01:55:55.018
And it is just a model prayer.

1160
01:55:55.018 --> 01:55:59.018
And the prayer is not the religious checkbox.

1161
01:55:59.018 --> 01:56:03.018
Checking off, coming to church every Sunday, just a quick prayer.

1162
01:56:03.018 --> 01:56:05.018
And when we have this prayer, then we are done again.

1163
01:56:05.018 --> 01:56:07.018
That is not what I mean by it.

1164
01:56:07.018 --> 01:56:10.018
It is a model that we can pray to say...

1165
01:56:10.018 --> 01:56:12.018
Thank you, Jesus, that you died for me.

1166
01:56:12.018 --> 01:56:15.018
You are my King. Shall we pray it together?

1167
01:56:15.018 --> 01:56:19.018
Thank you, Jesus. I believe that you are the Son of God.

1168
01:56:19.018 --> 01:56:23.018
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

1169
01:56:23.018 --> 01:56:25.018
Forgive me all my mistakes.

1170
01:56:25.018 --> 01:56:28.018
I invite you into my life, Jesus.

1171
01:56:28.018 --> 01:56:30.018
Give me a new start.

1172
01:56:30.018 --> 01:56:32.018
Help me to live for you.

1173
01:56:32.018 --> 01:56:35.018
From today on, I am a child of God.

1174
01:56:35.018 --> 01:56:38.018
Amen, amen, and amen.

1175
01:56:38.018 --> 01:56:40.018
Give God the glory. Hallelujah.

1176
01:56:43.018 --> 01:56:45.018
Have we learned something today, people?

1177
01:56:45.018 --> 01:56:46.018
Hallelujah.

1178
01:56:46.018 --> 01:56:49.018
Lord, I thank you for this day.

1179
01:56:49.018 --> 01:56:52.018
Lord, I send us out in the love of God.

1180
01:56:52.018 --> 01:56:54.018
In the grace of Jesus Christ.

1181
01:56:54.018 --> 01:56:58.018
Lord, that you will be with us every day of the coming week.

1182
01:56:58.018 --> 01:57:00.018
And we will see each other again in the name of Jesus.

1183
01:57:00.018 --> 01:57:02.018
Hallelujah. Bye-bye.
